<BaseLayout title="Venue — BBSW 2026">
  <h1>Venue &amp; Logistics</h1>
  <p><strong>Foster City, CA · November 5–6, 2026</strong></p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Location</h2>
    <p><strong>Crowne Plaza Foster City–San Mateo</strong><br />1221 Chess Drive<br />Foster City, CA 94404</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Crowne+Plaza+Foster+City+San+Mateo+1221+Chess+Drive+Foster+City+CA+94404">Open in Google Maps</a> · <a href="https://maps.apple.com/?q=Crowne+Plaza+Foster+City&address=1221+Chess+Drive,+Foster+City,+CA+94404">Apple Maps</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Hotel</h2>
    <p>The conference is held at the Crowne Plaza, so you can stay on site. Book directly with the hotel: <a href="tel:+16505705700">(650) 570-5700</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Parking</h2>
    <p>Free self-parking at the hotel.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Wi-Fi</h2>
    <p>Network name and password will be posted at the venue and updated here before the conference.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Dress Code</h2>
    <p>Business casual.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
